  "limitations": [
    "Native QtWebEngine, DRM, live login, streaming, downloads, permissions and printing are explicitly staged; this is not a browser engine implementation.",
    "Store rows use representative repository-named offline add-ons; ordering and World cinema membership are illustrative rather than a captured live stremio-addons.net response.",
    "PorticoData contains more catalogue titles than the 14 bundled Feria artworks; unbundled title art is a clearly labelled text fallback, never unrelated art.",
    "Feria header X choice is deliberately explicit (close selected space or whole app), because latest source contract leaves its final behavior open.",
    "Native-app-only Kobo and Apple Books are shown with original marks but not opened.",
    "Browser extension runtime/management is deferred by source contract; sidebar explains this and can navigate to Colosseum add-ons.",
    "OS/native engine-only effects and per-site DOM adaptation remain visual/local-state approximations."
  ]
}
